 "stimulus_html": "In <b>Collecting and Preparing Data</b>, the following data was given, as provided in the table, showing daily new cases of COVID-19. Since new cases were not reported on Saturdays and Sundays, those weekend cases were added to the Monday cases. One way to deal with the missing data is to use a centered simple moving average to smooth the time series.<br><br>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Date</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Weekday</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>New Case</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/18/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Monday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">3115</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/19/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Tuesday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4849</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/20/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Wednesday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">3940</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/21/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Thursday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4821</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/22/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Friday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4357</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/23/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Saturday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/24/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Sunday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/25/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Monday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">8572</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/26/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Tuesday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4463</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/27/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Wednesday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5323</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/28/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Thursday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5012</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/29/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Friday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">4710</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/30/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Saturday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">10/31/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Sunday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/1/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Monday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10415</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/2/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Tuesday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5096</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/3/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Wednesday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">6882</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/4/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Thursday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/5/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Friday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">6759</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/6/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Saturday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/7/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Sunday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/8/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Monday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10069</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">11/9/2021</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Tuesday</td>\n<td align=\"right\">5297</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><caption>Sample of COVID-19 Data Cases within 23 Days (source: https://data.cdc.gov/Case-Surveillance)</caption>\n</table>\n",
 "questions": [
